For something that doesn't change anything. That makes no sense.

Not that I'm all that urgent to have the stash tracker added to Nethack.  
It's nice to quote and brag. But if I wanted to know what spellbooks  
I've got stashed in my lair, I could just as easily copy and paste a  
list from the screen. That's awkward, but the possiblility already  
exists. Having it automated just saves me the work.

> I don't think it would end Burdening as a problem, though, it would
